<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM BELLSOUTH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM BELLSOUTH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>BellSouth Open tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>3-Alberto Berasetegui (Spain) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain) 6-4 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Karim Alami (Morocco) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat 8-Martin Damm (Czech Republic) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Marcus Ondruska (South Africa) beat David Caldwell (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Cecil Mamiit (U.S.) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand) 5-7 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Christian Rudd (Norway) beat 4-Alex Corretja (Spain) 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-5) 6-4</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat Bernd Kabacher (Germany) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Jan-Michael Gambill (U.S.) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 6-2 7-6 (9-7)</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 3-6 7-6 (7-1) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Stephen Downs (New Zealand) 4-6 6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
